name decorule
category Package
revision 55230
shortdesc Decorative swelled rule using font character
longdesc The package implements a decorative swelled rule using only a
longdesc symbol from a font installed with all distributions of TeX, so
longdesc it works independently, without the need to install any
longdesc additional software or fonts. This is the packaged version of
longdesc the macro which was originally published in the "Typographers'
longdesc Inn" column in TUGboat 31:1 (2010).
